    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“When something powered down, it didn’t stop talking to you.”</em></p><p>When you reduce a <strong>construct</strong>, vehicle, drone, mech, or other obviously artificial entity to 0 Integrity, you can ride the dying current for insight.</p><ul><li>Until the end of the current <strong>scene</strong>, you reroll the lowest die on your next <strong>tool check</strong> related to engineering, salvage, or repair.</li><li>This includes checks to stabilize wreckage, reclaim parts, or jury-rig field repairs.</li></ul>",
